  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=加入我们的Discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Additions 是 Mekanism 的官方附加组件，为 Mekanism 增加了一些额外的杂项功能。这些功能大多数曾在 1.12 及更早版本的主模块中出现，现在则在这里找到了新家。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">特性：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">幼年生物：</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 爬行者</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 末影人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 骷髅</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 流髑</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 凋灵骷髅</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">黑曜石 TNT</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">发光面板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">气球</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">各种形状的塑料方块变种</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">语音服务器</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模组链接：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Generators</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Tools</span></a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>文档</strong> 可在 Mekanism 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方维基</a> 上找到，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.indiewikis.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IndieWikis</a> 自豪地托管！它仍在不断完善中，如果你能贡献一份力量，请务必帮忙！</p><p><strong>源代码</strong> 可在 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong> 上获取！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>通过 Patreon 支持团队</strong>：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>通过 Ko-fi 支持团队</strong>：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
